OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'It was really scary': Mother describes
OL,4,Asheltering during Russia strikes on
OL,5,AKyiv bridge
OL,6,
OL,7,FClose to one end of the Pivnichnyi
OL,8,F(Northern) bridge there is a large
OL,9,Fcrater and in the pouring rain, water
OL,10,Fnow rushes through it to the river
OL,11,Fbelow. Chunks of tarmac and metal are
OL,12,Fscattered around.
OL,14,FAt its broadest point, the jagged hole
OL,15,Fis about eight metres wide.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
